---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout petals="header">
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <title th:text="|404 - ${site.title}|"></title>
  </Fragment>

  <div class="page-shell">
    <div class="error-page" id="petalScope">
      <p class="error-code">404</p>
      <h1 th:text="${#strings.defaultString(error.title, '页面走丢了')}">页面走丢了</h1>
      <p>这个地址下没有内容，它可能被移动或者已经删除了。</p>
      <a class="read-link" href="/" th:href="@{/}">返回首页 →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
